#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Unbound"
msgstr "Instalação do Unbound"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There should be a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>unbound</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Deveria existir um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano do "
"&quot;<command>unbound</command>&quot; depois de ele ser iniciado. Emita os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:105
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 88 unbound &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Unbound DNS Resolver\" -d /var/lib/unbound -u 88 \\\n"
"        -g unbound -s /bin/false unbound</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 88 unbound &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Resolvedor DNS Unbound\" -d /var/lib/unbound -u 88 \\\n"
"        -g unbound -s /bin/false unbound</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Unbound</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Unbound</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --with-pidfile=/run/unbound.pid &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --with-pidfile=/run/unbound.pid &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> package installed and want to build "
"html documentation, run the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o pacote &quot;<xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>&quot; instalado e "
"quiser construir a documentação &quot;HTML&quot;, [então] execute o seguinte"
" comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make doc</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make doc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:135
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/sbin/unbound-host /usr/bin/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/sbin/unbound-host /usr/bin/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the documentation, install it by running the following commands"
" as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu a documentação, [então] instale-a executando os seguintes "
"comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:144
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/unbound-&unbound-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/unbound-&unbound-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/unbound-&unbound-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/unbound-&unbound-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-libevent</option>: This option enables libevent support, "
"which allows for the use of large outgoing port ranges."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-libevent</option>: Essa opção habilita o suporte a libevent, "
"o que permite o uso de grandes intervalos de portas de saída."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/unbound.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-pyunbound</option>: This option enables building the Python "
"bindings. If you want to build the bindings, you also need to pass the "
"<envar>PYTHON_VERSION=&python3-majorver;</envar> environment variable to "
"configure."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-pyunbound</option>: Essa opção habilita construir as ligações"
" Python. Se você quiser construir as ligações, você também precisa passar a "
"variável de ambiente <envar>PYTHON_VERSION=&python3-majorver;</envar> para "
"configurar."

